VERIFICATION
Verification is intended to assist the Chocolatey moderators and community
in verifying that this package's contents are trustworthy.

The package downloads Keeper's official installer from the project's GitHub release:
  https://github.com/ashfordeOU/keeper/releases/download/v{{version}}/Keeper-setup-x64.exe
and checks it against SHA-256 {{sha256:Keeper-setup-x64.exe}},
the value listed in that release's SHA256SUMS.txt. The release also carries a
GitHub build attestation: gh attestation verify Keeper-setup-x64.exe --repo ashfordeOU/keeper
